<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="card-grid three" data-stagger><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/settlement-gap-fee-estimator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Settlement Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</b><span>See the disputed amount, a projected award and what you’d net after appraiser and umpire fees.</span><em>Open <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/acv-rcv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>ACV vs. RCV Holdback Calculator</b><span>Estimate the first actual cash value check, the depreciation held back, and the date to claim it.</span><em>Open <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/roof-area-pitch-estimator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 1000w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1000" height="667" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Roof Area &amp; Pitch Estimator</b><span>Turn a footprint and pitch into roof squares, waste, bundles and tear-off for multiple layers.</span><em>Open <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/hurricane-deductible-calculator/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="658" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Hurricane Deductible Calculator</b><span>Convert a 1–5% hurricane deductible into dollars and compare it with your flat deductible.</span><em>Open <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-calendar-builder/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Planner</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Claim Calendar Builder</b><span>Turn your date of loss into dated claim milestones and download them as a calendar file.</span><em>Open <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/appraisal-readiness-checkup/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tarp.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tarp-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tarp.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="765" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Checklist</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Appraisal Readiness Checkup</b><span>Twelve yes-or-no questions that score your file and build a to-do list before you demand appraisal.</span><em>Open <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/co-op-condo-claim-splitter/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/apartment.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/apartment-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/apartment.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Calculator</span></span><span class="card-b"><b>Co-op &amp; Condo Claim Splitter</b><span>Split a unit loss between the building’s master policy, your HO-6 and your own pocket.</span><em>Open <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></em></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faq-split"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the calculators together</h2><ol class="steps-list"><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-calendar-builder/">Claim calendar builder</a>: put every policy deadline on your calendar first.</li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/roof-area-pitch-estimator/">Roof area &amp; pitch estimator</a>: check the squares and steep charges on the roof line.</li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/acv-rcv-holdback-calculator/">ACV/RCV holdback calculator</a>: see what the first check should be and what’s held back.</li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/hurricane-deductible-calculator/">Hurricane deductible calculator</a>: learn what a percentage deductible really costs.</li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/co-op-condo-claim-splitter/">Co-op &amp; condo claim splitter</a>: split a unit loss between the building and your HO-6.</li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/settlement-gap-fee-estimator/">Settlement gap &amp; fee estimator</a>: test whether appraisal pays after fees.</li><li><a href="/appraisal-calculators/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">Appraisal readiness checkup</a>: make sure your file is ready before you demand appraisal.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="side-box side-call"><p class="side-t">Talk it through</p><p>A first conversation is free. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="side-tel" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg>(844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-orange btn-block" href="/reach-us/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
